  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Explore a city's 100 m Landsat land-surface-temperature grid, relate it to vegetation (NDVI), and set a budget to see which cooling interventions get funded, ranked by cooling per rupee, along with the projected post-mitigation temperature surface. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
